# Ignore large model binary files
**/onnx/*.onnx
**/onnx/*.onnx_data

# Model weights / tokenizers are downloaded or installed at runtime,
# they must never be committed (a 17MB tokenizer.json once leaked into
# the remote history via a "backup" commit).
# Only the placeholder files below are tracked.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
